  "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore(nix): bump flake to 1.31.3 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1949\n* Boot a pack prepared on a machine's storage from that storage instead of its source image's archive, and keep .wh. files in a pack's only layer by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1950\n* Refuse to branch a source still running the engine from before an upgrade by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1952\n* Keep agent unit tests off the storage disk of the machine they run on by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1955\n* Grow RAM live on CLI-started machines when no cgroup limit is in the way by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1956\n* Bump smolvm to 1.31.4 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1954\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.31.3...v1.31.4",
